    <h2>The Bottom Line</h2>
    <p>For most UK homeowners, the real savings in 2026 come from 0% VAT, SEG payments, and lower energy bills over time — not a single big grant. If you're on a low income or your home has a poor EPC rating, it's worth checking ECO4 or your regional scheme, since fully-funded installs are genuinely possible for qualifying households.</p>

